            <ArticleTitle>Assessing patient pain during dental laser treatment.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>90-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Patients reported little or no pain during or after treatment with a dental laser. With many people reporting fear of pain as their chief reason for not seeking dental care, lasers may offer a more acceptable treatment technique.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
